      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Barre’s diverse heritage includes immigrants from Italy, Scotland, Spain, Scandinavia, Greece, Lebanon, and Canada, making it Vermont’s most culturally varied city by the early 1900s.",
